TokenVerifier "1" --> "1" Auth0Client

FridgemateFacade "1" --> "1" InventoryService
FridgemateFacade "1" --> "1" HouseholdService
FridgemateFacade "1" --> "1" AccountService
FridgemateFacade "1" --> "1" PlacementService
FridgemateFacade "1" --> "1" ExpiryService
FridgemateFacade "1" --> "1" CookingService
FridgemateFacade "1" --> "1" ShoppingListService
FridgemateFacade "1" --> "1" CostSplitService
FridgemateFacade "1" --> "1" NotificationService
FridgemateFacade "1" --> "1" ExpiryAlertNotifier
FridgemateFacade "1" --> "1" CommandHistory
FridgemateFacade "1" --> "1" RecipeAgent
FridgemateFacade "1" --> "1" MealPlanAgent
FridgemateFacade "1" --> "1" FridgeCommandAgent
FridgemateFacade "1" --> "1" ReceiptParser
FridgemateFacade ..> RequestContext : receives

note top of FridgemateFacade
  <b>Facade pattern</b>
  Facade: FridgemateFacade
  Clients: the 10 FastAPI routers
  Subsystem: services, agents and CommandHistory
  Every method takes a RequestContext, so every
  call is limited to the member's own household.
end note

note bottom of ApiClient
  Every page calls ApiClient, and both clients
  send each request with the member's Auth0
  token. Every router checks that token with
  TokenVerifier (one dependency is drawn to
  keep the diagram readable).
end note
@enduml